- **Archivos Involucrados:** app/lib/GeminiAssistant.php, app/routes/auth.php, app/routes/products.php, app/routes/payments.php, app/routes/orders.php, app/routes/msg_service.php, inventory.php.bak/payments.php.bak/reports.php.bak (eliminados); app_multi/nuxt.config.js + ~15 componentes con `console.*` con datos reales
